# ARC-AGI-3 environments downloaded by the arc-agi toolkit at runtime (issue #177).
# 3.9 MB of upstream game code that arc_agi.Arcade() fetches on first use; it is a
# cache, not a source, and re-downloads on any machine that needs it.
environment_files/
